{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "#%lld": {},
    "%@ (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "%1$@ (%2$lld)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld": {},
    "%lld day streak": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "连续 %lld 天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%llds": {},
    "+ adds, × multiplies, ^ raises to a power (right to left: 2^3^2 = 2^9), ! is factorial and binds tightest, ( ) group.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "+ 加，× 乘，^ 乘方（从右往左：2^3^2 = 2^9），! 阶乘且优先级最高，( ) 括号。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new slot! Choose a type. Rot is paused while you decide.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新格子！选一种类型。选的时候不腐烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All rewards claimed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "道具已拿完"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All time": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "总榜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Amp": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增幅格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bag full and every key is at full durability. The repair kit was lost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背包满了，而且每个键都是满耐久，这个修键作废了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bag is empty": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背包是空的"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bag is full. Tap a key to repair it now (+%lld).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "背包满了。点一个键立即修理（+%lld）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Best: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最高：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Board": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "榜单"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Build the biggest number you can with today's keyboard. Your peak value is your score.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用今天的键盘拼出尽可能大的数，整局的峰值就是分数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the new slot's type.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "选择新格子的类型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Come back tomorrow for a new puzzle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明天再来，有新题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Config": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Convert a slot to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把一个格子改成%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't load the leaderboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排行榜加载失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cross 1,000 to earn a reward. Press one more 9.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "跨过 1,000 就有道具。再按一个 9。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cross a threshold for the first time to earn a reward: new keys, new slots, slot conversions, repair kits, or a freeze that pauses rot. The bag holds three items.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "首次跨过一个阈值就发一个道具：新键、新格子、改格、修键，或者暂停腐烂的冻结。背包放三个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Daily puzzle": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每日题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Digits count double: 9 becomes 18.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字按两倍计：9 当 18。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Digits rot at normal speed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字按正常速度腐烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Digits rot. Watch the red bar under a slot and wait for a digit to drop.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "数字会腐烂。看格子下面的红条，等一个数字掉一格。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Durability": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "耐久"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each key has a limited number of presses. At 0 it breaks. Repair kits restore it, up to its original durability. Filling a Rotten slot is free.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个键有固定次数，到 0 就坏。修键能修回来，但不超过初始耐久。填烂格不耗耐久。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Echo": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回声格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "End this run?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束这一局？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ended by": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ending": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every digit you place ticks down over time until it reaches 0. Overwrite it to refresh. Operators never rot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "填进去的数字会随时间往下掉，掉到 0 为止。覆盖它就能刷新。运算符不腐烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every key shows how many presses it has left. At 0 the key breaks. Repair kits bring it back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个键右下角是剩余次数，到 0 键就坏了。修键道具能修回来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fill it with 9. Three digits in the exponent are astronomically more than two.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "往里填个 9。指数从两位变三位，数大到天文级别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Finish": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freeze %llds": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "冻结 %lld 秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Freeze %llds added to your bag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "冻结 %lld 秒已放进背包。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Friends only": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只看好友"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game Center": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Game Center"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Goal": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Goal: build the biggest number you can. Everything else is a means to that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目标：拼出尽可能大的数。其它一切都是为了这个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Haptics": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "震动反馈"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How to play": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "怎么玩"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keys worn out": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "键全报废"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leaderboard": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "排行榜"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Long-press a slot to clear it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长按格子可清空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mirrors the slot two to its left. Free, can't be filled directly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "复制左边第二格的内容。免费，但不能直接填。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Never rots.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "永不腐烂。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New key unlocked: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁新键：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New slot! Choose its type": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
