        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "未登录"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Now tap a gap to place it. Position matters: next to ^ it becomes part of the exponent.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在点一个缝隙放进去。位置有讲究：放在 ^ 右边就成了指数的一部分。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One attempt per day. Everyone gets the same keyboard.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每天一次机会，所有人同一个键盘。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Operators": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
