    "Save it: tap the rotted slot, then press 9. Overwriting costs one press of durability.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "救它：先点那个烂掉的格子，再按 9。覆盖要花一次耐久。"
