        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已提交"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Submitting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提交中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a gap to place the %@ slot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一个缝隙放入%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a key to repair it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一个键来修理它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a slot to convert it to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点一个格子把它改成%@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's the game. One puzzle a day, one attempt, everyone on the same keyboard. Your peak is your score.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "就这些。每天一题，一次机会，所有人同一个键盘。峰值就是你的分数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The run ends when every key is broken with no repair kit left, when you tap End, or after five minutes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有键坏掉且没有修键、你点了结束、或者到五分钟，这局就结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version is too old for today's puzzle. Please update the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前版本太旧，无法玩今天的题，请更新应用。"
